    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A digital linear graphic novel which tells a captivating 7-chapter story about Milo, a child who slides into a conflict between high society, a time obsessed church and a rat-like resistance group growing stronger and stronger day by day... The Whisperers.<br><br>This comic fades the borders between comic, animation and game and uses innovative storytelling techniques to immerse the reader into an unforgettable, mystical world and story!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A digital linear graphic novel which tells a captivating 7-chapter story about Milo, a child who slides into a conflict between high society, a time obsessed church and a rat-like resistance group growing stronger and stronger day by day... The Whisperers.<br><br>This comic fades the borders between comic, animation and game and uses innovative storytelling techniques to immerse the reader into an unforgettable, mystical world and story!</p>",
    "short_description": "A digital linear graphic novel re-imagining events of the french revolution in a fictional setting. It fades the borders between comic, animation and game and uses innovative storytelling techniques to immerse the reader into an unforgettable, mystical world and story!",
